<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-SECURITAS H1 PROFIT LARGELY FLAT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SECURITAS H1 PROFIT LARGELY FLAT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish security company Securitas AB on Wednesday posted these figures for the first six months of the year.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				230 vs   228</p>
<p> Sales					 5,083 vs 4,286</p>
<p> EPS (crowns)				 2.26 vs  2.28</p>
<p> Operating costs			   4,177 vs 3,449</p>
<p> Administration costs			599 vs   541</p>
<p> Amortization of goodwill		   55 vs    49</p>
<p> Operating profit after amortization   252 vs   248</p>
<p> Net financial items		CHARGE  22 vs    19 CHARGE</p>
<p> Taxes paid				     59 vs    50</p>
<p> Deferred taxes				 11 vs    18</p>
<p> Net profit				    160 vs   161</p>
<p>NOTE -- Market expectations were for a pre-tax profit of 268 million crowns, a Reuter poll found.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
